## Central i18n registry: builds Portuguese (Brasil) and English Translation
## resources from plain dictionaries and registers them with TranslationServer.
## Keeps internal identifiers (flags, ids) untouched — only user-facing text
## keyed by a stable, English, all-caps id goes through tr().
##
## Coverage: settings/main/pause menus, the intro CGI (captions + skip
## confirm), the arrival phone call, Maciota's dialogue, and the mission
## board/objectives. Decorative world signage (shop/lift labels, generic
## exit-door prompts) and the CGI's debug-only preview HUD are intentionally
## NOT covered — see the task's final report for the honest gap list.

